The '''Spooky Festival''' is an [[event]] that takes place from {{Season|d=29|m=AU}} to {{Season|d=31|m=AU}}. It lasts for {{Green|3}} [[SkyBlock Time|SkyBlock Days]], during which monsters will have a chance to drop either {{Item|Green Candy|text=Green}} or {{Item|Purple Candy}}.

