=== Spooky Mobs ===
{{Main|Spooky Mobs}}

[[Spooky Mobs]] spawn during the night whilst a '''Spooky Festival''' is taking place and drop [[Candy]] when killed.

They spawn in the following [[Locations]]:
*{{Zone|Graveyard}}
*{{Zone|Wilderness}}
*{{Zone|Spider's Den}}
*{{Zone|Obsidian Sanctuary}}

=== Trick or Treat Chests ===
{{Main|Trick or Treat Chest}}
When a [[Mob]] is killed during a '''Spooky Festival''', there is a chance for a [[Trick or Treat Chest]] to spawn. The chance is {{Green|1%}} for normal Mobs and {{Green|3%}} for Spooky Mobs. The chance to drop Trick or Treat chests can be increased with the {{Item|Lucky Hoof}} or {{Item|Eternal Hoof}} accessories and with {{NPCSprite|Doug}} [[Doug#Spooky_Festival|Trick or Treat Enthusiast]] perk. Maximum chance to spawn is {{Green|4%}} and {{Green|6%}} for Spooky Mobs.

They can be opened to give the player either a {{Red|'''TRICK'''}} or {{Gold|'''TREAT'''}}, the former spawning a [[Spooky Mobs|Spooky Mob]] and the latter granting the player {{Green|1-3}} items.
==== Party Chests ====
{{Main|Party Chests}}
When {{NPCSprite|Foxy}}'s {{AN|A Time for Giving}} perk is active, [[Party Chests]] spawn instead of Trick or Treat Chests. They cannot spawn [[Spooky Mobs]], drop {{Green|2-4}} items and the items drop in larger quantities as well as having some unique loot.

