=== Rewards ===
The leaderboard is defined by the number of candy collected. It can be found next to the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}}.

==== Points ====
[[Green Candy]] grants {{Gold|1 point}}, and [[Purple Candy]] grants {{Gold|5 points}} towards the player's Candy Score. Candy obtained from [[Bat Piñata]]s does not count towards the leaderboard.

==== Rewards ====
Rewards will be given at the end of the '''Spooky Festival''' based on how many points the player obtained. Rewards can be claimed at the end of the event from the [[Fear Mongerer]] or from '''{{ID|Block of Gold!Event Rewards|nolink=yes}}''' found in the [[Calendar]]. Unclaimed rewards are only claimable for '''10''' [[Time Systems|SkyBlock Years]] from the year they are earned.

