== Trivia ==
*During [[w:Halloween|Halloween]] in real life, additional '''Spooky Festivals''' are organized.
*During {{NPCSprite|Dante}}'s term as [[Mayor]], the '''Spooky Festival''', among other events, was canceled.
*Candy Score is capped at {{Gold|5,000}} on {{Gamemode|Stranded}} profiles.
**This cap was added after several instances of {{Gamemode|Stranded}} players using tricks to obtain over 100,000 Candy Score, which is not feasible to the same extent on regular profiles.

